   ('health', 'Health and Body Vastu', '''<p>References to health, wellbeing, stress or Body Vastu do not offer diagnosis, cure, treatment or medical advice. Do not stop prescribed treatment, alter medication, delay a medical assessment or disregard qualified advice because of a consultation, remedy, video or article. Seek appropriate professional help for medical or mental health concerns.</p>'''),
   ('decisions', 'Money, relationships, career and property', '''<p>No reading guarantees income, investment performance, a job, business success, reconciliation, marriage, a legal result or a change in another person’s behaviour. Obtain qualified legal, financial or other professional advice for decisions in those areas.</p><p>Vastu guidance does not certify structural safety, property title, planning permission or investment suitability. A qualified professional must assess physical changes and regulatory requirements. Interpretations should not be used to make accusations about a partner, employee or family member.</p>'''),
